# 20500& SINTRAN boot on the DDR2 build - 15-min observation window.
# The 20-s hangboot window is far too short for a disc-bound boot
# (Tang measures 29-168 s); this waits for ANY letter output (banner).
FAILON System malfunction
FAILON ERRFATAL
SENDCR
PAUSE 2
LABEL boot SINTRAN from 20500 octal
SEND 20500&
EXPECT 900 [A-Za-z]
PAUSE 30
